{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id20248712"}, "name":{"label":"Jérémie L."}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-03-28T07:25:44-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"6.5"}, "id":{"label":"13896401121"}, "title":{"label":"Great weather app (was \"Too expensive\")"}, "content":{"label":"MULTI-MODEL FORECASTS: SHUT THE FROMT DOOR!!!!\n\n\nUPDATED REVIEW: The developer stopped asking to be tipped. Now this is just the best weather app around at the right price point.\n\nI love being able to customize exactly what the weather looks like. I love the smart UI, like the message telling you the temperature difference with the day before. I love the widget and live activities.\n\nI open Carrot literally every day.\n\nThis is a really great app.\n\nPREVIOUS REVIEW: I use this app, but I think the creator is crazy.\n\nNot only does his app cost a fortune, but he’s constantly begging to be tipped extra, as if he’s not making a fortune from our subscriptions.\n\nNo, this is not a 5-star experience.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=961390574&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
